    "blurb": "A darkened arena bowl glows with swaying phone torches that synchronise with the crowd, casting volumetric rays through atmospheric haze.",
    "prompt": "A dark arena lit only by a sea of phone torches, one bright point per person in the room swaying slowly; anyone can raise their light, which grows and throws a soft cone, and the swaying syncs as more people join. Make it striking on a big projected wall in a dark room: a bold composition, rich colour against real blacks, depth, glow, and motion that reads from across the room. Keep a demoscener's economy: lookup tables and fixed-size buffers kept in room.state, low-resolution offscreen buffers for any per-pixel work, nothing allocated inside hot loops, a steady 60fps at 1920x1080, and compact, clearly named code.",
